/**
 * @defgroup DspCore_Example_CoreVersion Version
 * @ingroup DspCore_Examples_Core
 * @brief Read the library and Foundation version metadata compiled into an application.
 *
 * @section DspCore_Example_CoreVersion_Goal Goal
 * Confirm the exact DspCore and Foundation releases seen by an application.
 * This is the smallest possible integration check before using a larger API.
 *
 * @section DspCore_Example_CoreVersion_Run Run
 * @code{.bash}
 * ./build/macos_arm64/bin/Debug/DspCore_Core_Version_d
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section DspCore_Example_CoreVersion_Output Output
 * @code{.text}
 * DspCore :: Core / Version
 * DspCore ....... 0.2.0
 * Foundation .... 2.0.8
 * @endcode
 *
 * The values identify the headers selected by the build, rather than a runtime
 * package discovered by the executable.
 *
 * @section DspCore_Example_CoreVersion_Code Implementation
 * \include Core/Version/Shared.cpp
 */
